@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram


[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / display journey details
Login : do / view journey details
Login : exit / user decides next action

state "User Decision" as UserDecision <<choice>>
Login --> UserDecision

state "Activate Driving Mode" as ActivateDrivingMode
UserDecision --> ActivateDrivingMode
ActivateDrivingMode : entry / activate driving mode or choose other options
ActivateDrivingMode : do / user selects option
ActivateDrivingMode : exit / proceed with selected action

state "Select Place to Eat" as SelectPlaceToEat
UserDecision --> SelectPlaceToEat
SelectPlaceToEat : entry / select place to eat
SelectPlaceToEat : do / view menu and order
SelectPlaceToEat : exit / order placed or continue journey

state AccidentNotification
UserDecision --> AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / notify relevant authorities in case of accident
AccidentNotification : do / send notification
AccidentNotification : exit / notification sent

state "Send Notifications" as SendNotifications
UserDecision --> SendNotifications
SendNotifications : entry / send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
SendNotifications : do / send notifications
SendNotifications : exit / notifications sent

state FeedbackCollection
UserDecision --> FeedbackCollection
FeedbackCollection : entry / provide feedback upon journey completion
FeedbackCollection : do / collect user feedback
FeedbackCollection : exit / feedback submitted

@enduml
